Por qué: el código propio de Aegis vive en browser/components/aegis (overlay):
hay que compilarlo (DIRS) y llamarlo al arrancar y en cada ventana. Se usan las
categorías de arranque de Firefox (BrowserComponents.manifest), sin tocar código.
Bug upstream: ninguno
Origen: Aegis

Aegis-Parche: 0500-ui/0001-gancho-aegis.patch

diff --git a/browser/components/BrowserComponents.manifest b/browser/components/BrowserComponents.manifest
index d3b32a07ec..a52f750b2f 100644
--- a/browser/components/BrowserComponents.manifest
+++ b/browser/components/BrowserComponents.manifest
@@ -250,3 +250,7 @@ category search-service-notification moz-src:///browser/components/search/Search
 
 category browser-newtab-external-component moz-src:///browser/components/search/SearchUIUtils.sys.mjs SearchNewTabComponentsRegistrant
 category browser-newtab-external-component moz-src:///browser/components/urlbar/UrlbarNewTabComponentRegistrant.sys.mjs UrlbarNewTabComponentRegistrant
+
+# Aegis: tema, protección estricta y buscador de serie (browser/components/aegis).
+category browser-before-ui-startup resource:///modules/aegis/AegisArranque.sys.mjs AegisArranque.inicio
+category browser-window-delayed-startup resource:///modules/aegis/AegisArranque.sys.mjs AegisArranque.ventana
diff --git a/browser/components/moz.build b/browser/components/moz.build
index 8a1611d5d1..238e3dc2f5 100644
--- a/browser/components/moz.build
+++ b/browser/components/moz.build
@@ -28,6 +28,7 @@ DIRS += [
     "about",
     "aboutlogins",
     "aboutwelcome",
+    "aegis",
     "aiwindow",
     "asrouter",
     "attribution",
